  "difficulty_reason": "Beyond ordinary finite-type cluster/subword and T-path expansion prerequisites, the proof establishes the new greedy-minus-antigreedy root/weight identity and analyzes every binary weight pattern for an arbitrary type-A Coxeter orientation. It matches the complete weight interval to suffix flips and all T-path monomials to complementary prefixes, then identifies the full Newton polytope and saturated monomial support. This uniform root/weight/path correspondence is beyond ordinary doctoral algebra qualifiers.",
